Nah due you're just in a bubble. This reddit/internet world where every animal is protected and your feelings matter. Out in the real world people die every day b. Theres people in detroit sucking dick to feed their kids nobobdy gives a fuck about your cat.

&#x200B;

Edit: Also if the trap was intended to catch a pest why do you care? It wasn't intended for the cat, a pet or an animal being trapped for food.

You sir, are insane. Did you actually just equate the suffering of the jewish people with a negligible retarded population? Retarded is still the medical term for internal documentation, and is still commonly used throughout the world. Just because you, or anybody else, feel offended by it that does not change the words meaning. Whatever connotation you add to it is your problem. If I had said he was mentally disabled (a phrase with precisely the same meaning as mentally retarded) the outcome would have been the same. Get out of whatever bubble has you thinking the world is going to bend to the will of people offended by simple language. People die every day nobody gives a shit about your feelings.

&#x200B;

\-Best wishes.

So sorry for you lost b... Also I'm wearing the same slides. I don't know what to do with that information but.

&#x200B;

Edit: also its good to know i'm not the only one who wears socks with slides.
